{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woken up suddenly,  you play as Michael Salvatore, a father tormented by the sudden disappearance of his daughter, Haze..As you investigate Haze\u2019s room, you\u2019ll uncover tools \u2014 like the axe embedded in her bedroom wall \u2014 that may seem like\u00a0 the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LATE 2 ESCAPE: CHAPTER 1 includes a a twisted compelling story that gets better through each chapter.While playing Chapter 1 you will collect items that belongs to your daughter Haze.  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_STEAM_INVENTORY_NEW_V002.png?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_LIGHTTHEWAY.gif?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matches are your main sources of light \u2014 and your only comfort. Use them to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ignite candles that reveal hidden symbols, paths, or ward off the oppressive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">darkness creeping in around you.&quot;Matches don\u2019t grow on body bags \u2014 use them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">like your life depends on it&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_STEam_keyobjects.png?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_AXEGIF_KEYOBJ.gif?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Found buried in the room of your missing daughter Haze, this axe is more than a tool </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 it\u2019s a turning point. Use it to shatter obstacles, and a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it a weapon? A message? Or just the start of something worse?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419560?t=1750957525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/1d440ba0b451c343edf45f8ac08e361bf6cc7fd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750957525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/65864be693952e32d96b01d165148fd07e4f7cec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750957525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/65864be693952e32d96b01d165148fd07e4f7cec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750957525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content that may not be suitable for all audiences. It includes graphic depictions of violence, intense psychological horror, and disturbing imagery. Players may encounter unsettling scenarios involving blood, gore, and death. There are also themes of fear, suspense, and intense psychological stress that could be distressing.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, there may be moments of implied or suggested trauma, such as the threat of physical harm, psychological manipulation, and disturbing sound design.\r\n\r\nGiven the nature of the game, players who are sensitive to topics like graphic violence, horror themes, or psychological tension should approach with caution."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woken up suddenly,  you play as Michael Salvatore, a father tormented by the sudden disappearance of his daughter, Haze..As you investigate Haze\u2019s room, you\u2019ll uncover tools \u2014 like the axe embedded in her bedroom wall \u2014 that may seem like\u00a0 the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LATE 2 ESCAPE: CHAPTER 1 includes a a twisted compelling story that gets better through each chapter.While playing Chapter 1 you will collect items that belongs to your daughter Haze.  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_STEAM_INVENTORY_NEW_V002.png?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_LIGHTTHEWAY.gif?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matches are your main sources of light \u2014 and your only comfort. Use them to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ignite candles that reveal hidden symbols, paths, or ward off the oppressive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">darkness creeping in around you.&quot;Matches don\u2019t grow on body bags \u2014 use them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">like your life depends on it&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_STEam_keyobjects.png?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/LATE2ESC_AXEGIF_KEYOBJ.gif?t=1750957525\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Found buried in the room of your missing daughter Haze, this axe is more than a tool </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 it\u2019s a turning point. Use it to shatter obstacles, and a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it a weapon? A message? Or just the start of something worse?</p>","developers":["DISPLANT","SILENT"],"genres":[{"d